Source
------
Repository: https://github.com/winterskycode/freudentranen
The complete corresponding source of each release is published next to its APK as totk-<tag>-source.tar.xz: this
repository at the release tag, plus the exact upstream sources the build fetched (MacNativeGames, Mesa, libadrenotools,
liblinkernsbypass, Opus, libvpx, zstd, Capstone, Noto Sans CJK), so the release can be rebuilt even if an upstream disappears. The toolchains
(the Android NDK and SDK, the .NET SDK 10.0.402) are the published versions pinned in port/android/tools/env.sh and
port/android/tools/release.sh.

Why the AGPL-3.0
----------------
The Vulkan renderer (port/android/vk), the code rewriter's Android target and the GPU driver build
(port/android/tools/build_gpu_driver.py) come from the D2R Android port, which is AGPL-3.0, so this project as a whole is distributed under the AGPL-3.0. Code its
authors released under MIT, BSD or other permissive licences keeps that licence and its copyright notice; the AGPL-3.0
applies to the combined work and to this project's changes, and does not take away the permissions those licences
grant for the original code.

