  * d2r-android v0.6.1 by sydeEvans (https://github.com/sydeEvans/d2r-android) -- MIT. The Android port of d2r-mobile
    that the D2R Android port imported; part of port/android/vk descends from it. Text:
    LICENSES/MIT-d2r-android-sydeEvans.txt.
  * The D2R Android port by ImL1s (aa22396584 on GitLab), android/v2 branch at commit 99cac6a, published at
    https://gitlab.com/aa22396584/d2r-mobile and mirrored at https://github.com/akari-sora/d2r-mobile (neither is public
