    parts), the GPU driver loader (gpu_driver.c), present rect, pending ranges, the POSIX host helpers, the Vulkan
    function table and the D2R host headers in port/android/vk/d2r. Its dm/android/tools/build_gpu_driver.py became
    port/android/tools/build_gpu_driver.py, and the Android target of its dm/tools/patch_nso.py (DM_TARGET=android)
    was merged into port/rewriter/d2r/patch_nso.py. Text: port/android/vk/LICENSE.AGPL.
    MODIFIED: this project has changed these files continuously since 2026-10-20 to run Tears of the Kingdom (its
    command records, runtime shader translation, render state, pipelines, synchronisation, frame generation and
    upscaling, pacing; the rewriter's TOTK call windows and stack handling). This repository's history starts at its first
    public commit, so it does not record the changes made before then.

