Not part of this project
------------------------
  * Lossless Scaling's frame generation shaders: never part of this project or the APK. Players who own Lossless Scaling
    choose their own Lossless.dll in the app, which translates its shaders on the device and does not keep the file.

No game content
---------------
This repository and the APK contain no game program, game data, keys, firmware or saves. Players supply their own copy
of the game and their console's keys. This is an independent, non-commercial project, not affiliated with, endorsed or
sponsored by Nintendo. The Legend of Zelda and Nintendo Switch are trademarks of Nintendo.
